# Reproducibility depends on files being byte-identical across machines, and this
# repo is developed on Windows where autocrlf would otherwise rewrite every
# checkout. Pin LF in the repository *and* the working tree so a shard hash or a
# tokenizer digest means the same thing on Linux, macOS and Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Token shards and checkpoints are binary; never let git touch their bytes.
*.bin binary
*.pt  binary
